# Integration Tests Directory

This directory contains integration tests that verify complex workflows
spanning multiple components. These tests use LazilyRefreshDatabase
for better performance.

## Test Organization

- Place tests that involve multiple services here
- Use for end-to-end workflow testing
- Tests should verify complete user journeys

## Example Usage

```php
it('completes a full character creation workflow', function () {
    // Test complete workflow from start to finish
});
```
